4.5.stable.official [876b29033] and v4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]\n- Not reproducible in: v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12400F (12 threads) - 63.86 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn Godot 4.5, when using the TabContainer node with a sufficient number of children, the left and right arrow buttons appear. These buttons are meant to be highlighted when hovered, but instead, they become invisible until the mouse cursor is moved away.\n\nIn Godot 4.4.1, the left and right arrow buttons are correctly highlighted when hovered.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/39f9b5b3-54de-4264-8c18-19a2330137e9\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. In Godot 4.5.x create a new scene with a control node as the root node. \n2. Add a tab container node and give it child nodes until the left and right arrow button appear. \n3. Run the scene and hover the buttons. They should turn invisible.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ATho